# Launches from Lave station and docks again by hand: a half loop back along the slot's axis, a roll to
# match the station's spin, and straight in. The timings were found by probing the reference, which
# paced time makes repeatable to the frame.
wait 3
key space; wait 4
key F1                             # launch: the tunnel, then space
wait 2
digest tunnel 2fa7b59ec4605c86e49f4b43b333427a251b2c0e20066e3f0ea2360492bcc3b3
picture tunnel 11b270513cbf4a4584572c273c4d8f8104180ce34b17ea37f6a56683a7f76bf7
wait 4
digest launched a344af805daa84d4bf8a877cca04491dae9342d47b68024d03f38c895870d377
picture launched 5066aec27c1853140a523b77298a305e72b76fd65003992fe7a5e46c7614f38e
down Down; wait 1.17; up Down      # pitch through 180 degrees, to 3E7h: aimed a little low, at the slot
wait 0.5
digest turned 5171a83b2092f8131b65552da9a7ae04ae925854b2fa330884f9d79f5ff7299a
picture turned 42e90c37dd48323ecd5010425e40ed750ca6773b6ab30b66249d198c8311ee42
down Right; wait 0.65; up Right    # roll to the station's spin at arrival
wait 3
shot approach
digest approach 5eb688d7f27d8bf88a13688905096ccf796de39bc5487e407dbd7237645532e4
picture approach d5e06de13b694b8a9211219a69a9314365ace00fb1a881c8b455a602c5f89982
wait 3
digest docking 4ea4d3c8253a489500c9d2c9b550c6450cb203b6c7a992f7a7a7f905a73af7a9
picture docking 9daecc8d19d51c3589982e5dbcb813764d6b1c7a303ab65a21e2edb52fedd840
wait 4                             # the tunnel, then the status screen
shot docked
digest docked f39357b391a56594a54a11c068e7d116d61a07bc35b2c1a17fd586e4a9d14431
picture docked b7ee12a527ba7c2fc4299cc3a1c8065e786260b87cad506b70e2b515d759d4e5
